flowchart TB
  accTitle: Private originals, versioned templates and derived PDFs
  accDescr: Original uploads remain private and byte-for-byte intact. Parsed datasets and saved mapping profiles combine with a concrete template version in a generation job. The job creates derived PDFs and a provenance manifest. Address-page derivation also creates a new document. Applicable validation, review and approval remain necessary before a separate dispatch.
  upload["Original upload"] --> original[("Private original\nidentity + exact bytes retained")]
  data["CSV · workbook · structured data"] --> parse["Parse sheets + rows"]
  parse --> mapping["Mapping profile\nfields · transformations · preview"]
  template["Studio template\nconcrete version + settings"] --> generate
  mapping --> generate["Generation job"]
  generate --> derived[("New derived PDF\nseparate identity + private bytes")]
  generate --> provenance["Manifest + provenance"]
  original --> address["Add a postal address page"]
  address --> derived
  derived --> checks["Applicable scan + validation + preview"]
  checks --> approval["Later immutable approval"]
  approval --> dispatch["Separate dispatch acceptance"]
  classDef focus fill:#e8edff,stroke:#2450db,color:#242c38,stroke-width:1.5px
  class original,derived focus
